A||||6||FieroPerformance||Rebuild Progress Pictures... not many yet.||||1||
Z||000000||FieroPerformance||10-29-2001||06:16 PM||||I've been rebuilding my engine for a while now and taking pictures with a disposable camera along the way. I haven't finished the roll so I haven't gotten them developed. I took a few pictures of my block, crank, and pistons for photography with my good camera. They are in black and white but I thought I would post them anyway.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine1pic.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine2pic.jpg"> <P>Here is what I've done or am doing:<P>I had the block, heads, connecting rods and crank reconditioned. power forged pistons that are higher compression about (9.1:1). I put in a powermax 2030 cam, heavy duty clutch and pressure plate, new gaskets and seals all around, new oil pump, all new bearings, new push rods, roller tip rocker arms, new valve springs, valve job, exhaust valves ported.<P>I am going to get a new exhaust system and have the car repainted as well.<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||DKOV||10-29-2001||07:35 PM||||Oooo... Black and White... VERY artistic!<P>I mean that.  Great lighting and good textures.  Are you a professional?<P>I wish I could make my parts look that good  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>DKOV -||||reg||12
Z||000002||FieroPerformance||10-29-2001||09:26 PM||||Thanks DKOV! ... No I'm not pro, I turned those prints in as part of my second project in photography class, I got an 87%  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> We develop the film ourselves and make the prints, it probably would have turned out better if I took the film somewhere to have it processed. The fact that all that was either brand new or cleaned so well I could eat off of it didn't hurt  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>More pics to come. Probably won't be for a while though.<P>-Charlie||||reg||1
Z||000003||voyagerspe||10-29-2001||11:36 PM||||I really like your pics, I think im going to blow the dust off my 35mm (ill put the digital camera away for awhile)And take some B&W shots of my fiero.  I have to thank you I almost forgot how cool B&W photos are  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  ||||reg||7
